      "content": "Yeah, the power analysis is a bit thin, I'll admit. I was thinking about how to word it so it doesn't look like a weakness. If we frame it as a \"high-fidelity pilot study\" or something similar, do you think that would satisfy the reviewers, or is that too much of a stretch? I really want this to get in.",
